  "description": "Non-Material Amendment to planning permission reference\r\n202512 granted 20/04/2021 to allow for minor amendment to block B, D and E\r\napproved via Planning Permission 202512&nbsp;to allow fire safety\r\nimprovements with internal works including removal of internal connectivity\r\nbetween the ground floor escape route and ancillary spaces, with the creation\r\nof a dedicated sterile egress directly from the stair cores including provision\r\nof new doors and walls; addition of smoke shafts and/ or Automatic Opening Vent\r\n(AOV) windows in communal corridors to facilitate ventilation for each sterile\r\nlobby; increased provision of external ground floor doors to flats;\r\nredistribution of refuse and cycle spaces, along with elevation changes\r\nincluding a total of 9no. additional ground floor doors; removal of 2no. doors;\r\nchanges to the detail of 7 no. ground floor doors; revision to the detail of\r\n2no. windows and the conversion of 22no. approved windows to AOV’s.",
